HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra0069.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra0070.fits,spectra0071.fits, spectra0072.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0073.fits,spectra0074.fits, spectra0075.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0076.fits,spectra0077.fits, spectra0078.fits were                HISTORY combined using a robustweighted mean with a sigma threshold of          HISTORY 8.  Aperture 1modifications: The scale factors were determined          HISTORY using order 1and are: 0.9924998938530244,                               HISTORY 1.0693813594249202,0.9060616183369541, 1.1825014238610203,              HISTORY 1.0076143226024878,0.9823586757937918, 1.1039168511833406,              HISTORY 0.9724247372412682,1.08925451883877, 0.9227369091237773.                END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             